14abff2e-f429-4481-bafe-9e7cc7296356	meituan-official-careers	4751700815	美团	Logistics Operations Analysis & Enablement Expert 履约经营分析与赋能专家	https://zhaopin.meituan.com/web/position/detail?jobUnionId=4751700815	unknown	bachelor	unknown	no	collector/0.1.0	67ea17a591e52c3c853c17be2fe495d6f916be4a7f4e1448f27af6bbc152ccc1	This is a high-impact, strategy-and-execution hybrid role responsible for building the analytical framework and frontline enablement engine that drives operational excellence across our instant delivery network. You will directly influence company-wide operations strategy while shaping the performance and growth culture of our frontline teams across multiple markets.\n这是一个高影响力、战略与执行并重的复合型岗位，负责构建支撑即时配送网络卓越运营的分析框架和前线赋能引擎。你将直接影响公司整体的运营战略，同时塑造多个市场前线团队的绩效与成长文化。\n\n\n1. Instant Delivery Business Analysis: Own the logistics analytical engine behind our on-demand delivery operations. You will define how we measure success across on-time rate, cancellation rate, capacity-to-demand balance, and rider productivity, then dig into the data when numbers move, find the real story behind anomalies, and turn findings into strategy leadership actually acts on.\n1.即时配送业务经营\n掌控我们按需配送业务背后的物流分析引擎。你将定义如何衡量准时率、取消率、运力与需求平衡以及骑手效率等核心指标的成功标准，在数据波动时深入挖掘异常背后的真实原因，并将研究发现转化为管理层切实可行的战略建议。\n\n2. Frontline Enablement & Training: Be the architect of how our frontline teams learn and grow. You will turn scattered best practices into a repeatable playbook, design recognition and incentive programs that make strong performance visible and rewarded, and build a culture where teams push themselves rather than waiting to be pushed.\n2. 前线赋能与培训\n成为前线团队学习与成长机制的设计者。你将把零散的最佳实践整理成可复用的方法论手册，设计让优秀表现可见且可奖励的认可与激励方案，并打造团队自我驱动而非被动推动的文化。\n\n3. Policy Localization: Be the bridge between headquarters strategy and regional reality. You will take company-wide policies and make them work on the ground across markets, adapting where local conditions demand it and proving the impact with measurable results.\n3. 政策本地化\n成为总部战略与区域实际之间的桥梁。你将把公司层面的政策在各个市场因地制宜地落地执行，在本地条件需要时做出灵活调整，并用可量化的成果证明其影响。\n\n4. Cross-Regional Process Optimization:Give regional teams a voice at headquarters. You will surface the operational pain points field teams live with every day, rally the right cross-functional owners to fix them, and keep the improvement loop running market by market.\n4. 跨区域流程优化\n让区域团队在总部拥有发声渠道。你将挖掘一线团队日常面临的运营痛点，协调各跨部门负责人加以解决，让改进循环在各个市场持续运转。\n\n1. Bachelor's degree or above, 3+ years of experience in operations analytics, frontline enablement, or a similar hybrid strategy-and-execution role within high-volume logistics, on-demand delivery, or gig-economy platforms.\n1. 本科及以上学历，3年以上运营分析、前线赋能或类似战略与执行复合岗位经验，具备高体量物流、按需配送或零工经济平台背景。\n\n2. Proven track record in building operational frameworks, training programs, or performance management systems for frontline or field teams.\n2. 在为前线或一线团队搭建运营框架、培训项目或绩效管理体系方面有可验证的成果。\n\n3. Possess strong data analysis capabilities(SQL) and execution skills. \n3. 具备较强的数据分析能力（SQL）与执行能力。\n\n4. Excellent stakeholder management and cross-functional coordination skills, with experience working across regional and headquarters teams.\n4. 出色的跨部门协作能力，有区域团队与总部协同工作的经验。\n\n5. Fluency in English required; Arabic or additional regional languages strongly preferred given the localization scope.\n5. 英语流利为必备条件；鉴于本地化工作范围，掌握阿拉伯语或其他区域语言者优先。	让改进循环在各个市场持续运转。 1. Bachelor's degree or above,	3年以上	\N	3	\N	[]	["operations_analysis", "sql", "data_analysis", "english"]	[{"skill_id": "operations_analysis", "evidence_text": "rms. 1. 本科及以上学历，3年以上运营分析、前线赋能或类似战略与执行复合岗位经验，"}, {"skill_id": "sql", "evidence_text": "alysis capabilities(SQL) and execution skil"}, {"skill_id": "data_analysis", "evidence_text": "on skills. 3. 具备较强的数据分析能力（SQL）与执行能力。 4. Ex"}, {"skill_id": "english", "evidence_text": "的经验。 5. Fluency in English required; Arabic or"}]	{"tag": null, "desc": "", "name": "Logistics Operations Analysis & Enablement Expert  履约经营分析与赋能专家", "jobDuty": "This is a high-impact, strategy-and-execut