arket.\\n4. 跨区域流程优化\\n让区域团队在总部拥有发声渠道。你将挖掘一线团队日常面临的运营痛点，协调各跨部门负责人加以解决，让改进循环在各个市场持续运转。", "jobType": "3", "cityList": [{"code": null, "name": "利雅得", "sort": null, "bgNode": false, "mapping": null, "subCode": null, "children": null, "outerCode": null}], "workYear": null, "highLight": "Direct ownership of the operational analytics and enablement function across multiple high-growth markets.\\nHigh-visibility role with regular exposure to headquarters leadership and cross-functional strategy discussions.\\nOpportunity to build regional operational frameworks from the ground up and define how frontline teams are enabled, measured, and motivated.\\nClear growth path toward broader operations leadership as the function expands.\\nCompetitive compensation and benefits package commensurate with seniority and scope.", "jobFamily": "运营类", "jobSource": "1", "jobStatus": "000", "otherInfo": null, "projectId": null, "department": [{"code": null, "name": "Keeta", "sort": null, "bgNode": false, "mapping": null, "subCode": null, "children": null, "outerCode": null}], "jobUnionId": "4751700815", "precedence": null, "expiredTime": null, "projectName": null, "refreshTime": 1795089617000, "firstPostTime": null, "jobFamilyGroup": "产品运营", "jobRequirement": "1. Bachelor's degree or above, 3+ years of experience in operations analytics, frontline enablement, or a similar hybrid strategy-and-execution role within high-volume logistics, on-demand delivery, or gig-economy platforms.\\n1. 本科及以上学历，3年以上运营分析、前线赋能或类似战略与执行复合岗位经验，具备高体量物流、按需配送或零工经济平台背景。\\n\\n2. Proven track record in building operational frameworks, training programs, or performance management systems for frontline or field teams.\\n2. 在为前线或一线团队搭建运营框架、培训项目或绩效管理体系方面有可验证的成果。\\n\\n3. Possess strong data analysis capabilities(SQL) and execution skills. \\n3. 具备较强的数据分析能力（SQL）与执行能力。\\n\\n4. Excellent stakeholder management and cross-functional coordination skills, with experience working across regional and headquarters teams.\\n4. 出色的跨部门协作能力