b0378e11-211f-4c26-b8ce-8ec82f008fe3	cicc-official-careers	151099146	中金公司	Business Analyst Specialist(J18722)	https://cicc.zhiye.com/social/jobs	unknown	bachelor	experienced	no	collector/0.2.0	97277ae24c70d7dd41f3b8568ba752f59c62011a87d04b4b9284ff2208e36296	1. Responsible for building a customer group data analysis framework, enhancing data analysis and insights, and conducting in-depth exploration of customer group characteristic tag maps, behavioral preference maps, and demand evolution paths. Identify business growth opportunities to support data-driven, and refined customer group operations.\n2. Responsible for data insights and analysis of customer group operations, tracking and analyzing the conversion effects of various operational strategies, and continuously optimizing operational strategies based on data analysis results. Integrate deeply with business scenarios to innovate and deliver customer group decision-making tools such as strategy deduction models.\n3. Responsible for exploring effective data analysis and experimental methods, conducting in-depth research on business paths and conversion funnels, gaining insights into user behaviors and psychology, improving operational ideas, and providing suggestions and strategies to maximize user value.\n4. Research and investigate industry-leading data application tools, deconstruct customer value elements, and refine reusable customer group value identification tools.\n5. Responsible for other data analysis-related tasks or other assignments from the manager.\n\n1. 负责构建客群数据分析体系框架，强化数据的分析与洞察，深度洞察客群特征标签图谱、行为偏好图谱与需求演化路径。洞察业务增长机会，支持客群的数据化、精细化运营；\n2. 负责客群运营数据洞察及分析，跟踪分析各类运营策略的转化效果，并根据数据分析结果，持续优化运营策略；深度融合业务场景，创新输出客群策略推演等客群决策工具；\n3. 负责探索有效的数据分析和实验方法，深入研究业务路径和转化漏斗，洞察用户行为和心理，改进运营思路，为实现用户价值的最大化，输出改进建议和提升策略；\n4. 研究并调研行业领先的数据应用工具，解构客户价值要素，提炼可复用的客群价值识别工具；\n5. 负责其他数据分析相关工作或上级交办的其他工作。\n\n1. At least 5 years of work experience in wealth management, Finance institution or related industries, with at least 2 years of relevant work experience.\n2. Demonstrate integrity, humility and a strong work ethic, with excellent moral character.\n3. Possess extensive financial expertise, familiarity with overseas financial markets, and foundational knowledge in statistics, machine learning, and financial operations.\n4. Experience in data application domains, with a keen data-driven focus to identify issues, uncover connections between business details and data, discern growth opportunities, and provide analytical insights and recommendations to support business operations.\n5. Experience in large-scale data analysis and modeling, proficient in SQL, and familiar with at least one modeling language (R/SAS/PYTHON, etc.); experience in data marketing projects and familiarity with data marketing workflows.\n6. Innovative mindset with a spirit of exploration, coupled with strong communication and teamwork skills.\n7. Fluent in both written and spoken Chinese and English, with excellent communication and negotiation skills in a cross-cultural environment. Overseas work or living experience is preferred.\n\n1. 5 年以上财富管理、金融机构或相关金融行业从业经验，及2年以上相关岗位工作经验；\n2. 诚信正直、低调谦逊、艰苦奋斗，具备良好的道德品质;\n3. 具有丰富的金融专业知识，熟悉了解境外金融市场，具备基本统计学、机器学习、金融业务相关知识；\n4. 数据应用领域工作经验，对数据敏感，能从数据中发现问题，发掘业务细节与数据之间的联系，洞察业务增长机会，并以分析师的视角给业务提供建议支持；\n5. 拥有大规模数据分析及建模经验，熟练使用SQL，并熟悉一种建模语言R/SAS/PYTHON等；具备数据营销相关项目经验，熟悉数据营销相关工作内容；\n6. 勇于创新，具备探索精神，并拥有良好的沟通与团队协作能力；\n7. 精通中文和英语的书面及口头表达，在跨文化环境中具备卓越的沟通与谈判能力;有海外工作或生活经验为佳。	本科及以上	5 年以上	2026-11-17T16:00:00.000Z	5	\N	[]	["data_analysis", "machine_learning", "sql", "python", "english"]	[{"skill_id": "data_analysis", "evidence_text": "manager. 1. 负责构建客群数据分析体系框架，强化数据的分析与洞察，深度洞察"}, {"skill_id": "machine_learning", "evidence_text": "edge in statistics, machine learning, and financial oper"}, {"skill_id": "sql", "evidence_text": "ling, proficient in SQL, and familiar with"}, {"skill_id": "python", "evidence_text": "ing language (R/SAS/PYTHON, etc.); experience"}, {"skill_id": "english", "evidence_text": "spoken Chinese and Eng