38a283ca-c561-4773-aa6b-778115d1bc9c	wondershare-official-careers	620909495	万兴科技	创意策划经理	https://wondershare.zhiye.com/social/jobs	unknown	bachelor	experienced	unknown	collector/0.2.0	731d119c4da8dbcaef2ee63e70cd646c7d4d29b3e01bbdf679f1e090281c0a4a	Are you a Creative Strategy and Development Strategist with deep background in motion graphics. Do you have a passion for developing and creating digital products? This is an excellent opportunity to showcase your skills. We are seeking an individual who embodies the qualities of a Digital Product Strategist, Senior Art Director, Motion Designer, and product-minded creator to join our team. Your responsibilities will span from developing motion graphics-inspired products to collaborating on research, aligning with stakeholders, and utilizing your design expertise to create innovative offerings for the market. High technical and creative abilities are essential for success in this role. Ability to work independently and with a team.\n\nA professional background in UX is necessary or this role and any experience with digital production development is a plus.\n\nYou will wear many hats:\n\nDeveloping Strategic Roadmaps: Crafting comprehensive roadmaps for the creation, deployment, and lifecycle management of creative assets, ensuring they align with the company’s goals and market needs.\n\nMarket and Trend Analysis: Conducting in-depth analysis of market trends, competitor strategies, and customer feedback to guide the strategic direction of creative asset development.\n\nInnovation Leadership: Leading the exploration and incorporation of innovative design trends and technologies into creative asset development to keep the company at the forefront of the industry.\n\nCross-functional Collaboration: Working closely with marketing, product development, and design teams to ensure creative assets are effectively integrated into broader company initiatives.\n\nTarget Audience Analysis: Identifying and understanding target audience segments to tailor creative assets that meet their preferences and needs.\n\nAsset Performance Analysis: Utilizing data analytics to assess the performance of creative assets, identifying areas for optimization to improve engagement and conversion rates.\n\nFeedback Integration: Implementing a feedback loop with users and internal teams to gather insights and continuously refine and improve creative assets.\n\nEmerging Technologies: Staying abreast of emerging technologies and design tools that can enhance the creation and distribution of creative assets.\n\nSoftware and Tools Evaluation: Recommending and implementing software solutions and tools that improve the efficiency and effectiveness of creative asset production.\n\nProfessional proficiency in After Effects, C4D, Premiere, Photoshop, Illustrator, and any experience with AI tools is a plus.\nEagerness to learn emerging design technologies, including AI tools such as MidJourney, Stable Diffusion, and Runway, as well as in-house proprietary apps and programs.\nConduct data research to evaluate the performance of digital assets or related company products and submit reports.\nStay informed about industry trends and provide insights to guide strategic product and workflow development.\nKnowledge of digital products and the ability to work methodically, meet deadlines, and proactively address scheduling issues.\nExperience in collaborative group settings, adept at taking direction and providing solutions both creatively and technically.\nAbility to follow instructions and deliver concise and efficient solutions.\nAbility to communicate with our teams in Asia of a regular basis and address all stakeholder’s concerns.\nExcellent presentation skills.	本科	1-3年	2024-09-17T16:00:00.000Z	1	3	[]	[]	[]	{"Id": "29cad6b6-65fc-40fb-b08e-8c591eb8b80a", "Org": "场景组", "Cash": 0, "Duty": "Are you a Creative Strategy and Development Strategist with deep background in motion graphics. Do you have a passion for developing and creati